.TH GRID_SET_COUNT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_set_count \- Tell the grid how many items it holds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "void grid_set_count(Grid *g, int count);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tell the grid how many items it holds. Clamps selected into range (\-1 when empty, otherwise 0..count\-1) and scroll so the selection stays visible. Call after grid_init and again whenever the underlying list changes length, so a stale cursor can never point past the end.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_init (3),
.BR grid_select (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
